{"page":226,"width":1760,"height":2630,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"Part 3","words":[{"text":"Part","x":575,"y":499,"width":137,"height":50},{"text":"3","x":735,"y":501,"width":37,"height":48}]},{"text":"프호茂/Ä 뉴/Å,外","words":[{"text":"프호茂/Ä","x":153,"y":603,"width":571,"height":142},{"text":"뉴/Å,外","x":794,"y":593,"width":362,"height":165}]},{"text":"2尸夕c髥55","words":[{"text":"2尸夕c髥55","x":166,"y":773,"width":291,"height":67}]},{"text":"시스템은 일반적으로 병행하게 또는 병렬로 실행되는 수백 개 또는 수천 개의 스레드로 구성된","words":[{"text":"시스템은","x":283,"y":984,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"일반적으로","x":431,"y":984,"width":164,"height":34},{"text":"병행하게","x":608,"y":985,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"또는","x":744,"y":986,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"병렬로","x":817,"y":986,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"실행되는","x":914,"y":987,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"수백","x":1038,"y":988,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"개","x":1107,"y":988,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":1144,"y":989,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"수천","x":1210,"y":989,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"개의","x":1278,"y":987,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"스레드로","x":1344,"y":988,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"구성된","x":1473,"y":988,"width":93,"height":34}]},{"text":"다. 스레드는 종종 사용자 데이터를 공유한다. 한편 운영체제는 다양한 자료구조를 지속적으로","words":[{"text":"다.","x":285,"y":1041,"width":39,"height":33},{"text":"스레드는","x":339,"y":1041,"width":136,"height":33},{"text":"종종","x":486,"y":1042,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"사용자","x":564,"y":1041,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":674,"y":1043,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"공유한다.","x":807,"y":1044,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"한편","x":946,"y":1045,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"운영체제는","x":1014,"y":1045,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"다양한","x":1167,"y":1046,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"자료구조를","x":1261,"y":1045,"width":142,"height":34},{"text":"지속적으로","x":1414,"y":1045,"width":154,"height":34}]},{"text":"업데이트하여 여러 스레드를 지원한다. 공유 데이터에 대한 액세스가 제어되지 않으면 경쟁 조","words":[{"text":"업데이트하여","x":284,"y":1097,"width":198,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":498,"y":1098,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"스레드를","x":574,"y":1100,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"지원한다.","x":714,"y":1101,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"공유","x":856,"y":1102,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"데이터에","x":928,"y":1102,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"대한","x":1053,"y":1103,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"액세스가","x":1118,"y":1103,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"제어되지","x":1241,"y":1102,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"않으면","x":1365,"y":1102,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"경쟁","x":1464,"y":1101,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"조","x":1532,"y":1104,"width":34,"height":26}]},{"text":"건이 존재하여 데이터 값이 손상될 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"건이","x":283,"y":1153,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"존재하여","x":361,"y":1155,"width":134,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":511,"y":1156,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"값이","x":620,"y":1158,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"손상될","x":693,"y":1158,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":796,"y":1159,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":839,"y":1158,"width":64,"height":34}]},{"text":"프로세스 동가화는 경쟁 조건을 피하고자 공유 데이터에 대한 액세스를 제어하는 도구를","words":[{"text":"프로세스","x":349,"y":1213,"width":135,"height":33},{"text":"동가화는","x":500,"y":1214,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"경쟁","x":647,"y":1216,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"조건을","x":721,"y":1215,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"피하고자","x":827,"y":1215,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"공유","x":956,"y":1216,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"데이터에","x":1028,"y":1216,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"대한","x":1153,"y":1215,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"액세스를","x":1220,"y":1215,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"제어하는","x":1346,"y":1214,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"도구를","x":1474,"y":1215,"width":94,"height":33}]},{"text":"사용한다. 이러한 도구를 잘못 사용하면 교착 상태를 포함한 시스템 성능이 저하될 수 있으므","words":[{"text":"사용한다.","x":287,"y":1269,"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":447,"y":1271,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"도구를","x":559,"y":1273,"width"